{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-alba-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"alba-tower-reportage-properties-al-satwa","about":"Alba Tower is a modern 12-story residential complex developed by major developer Reportage Properties. The project has a total of 72 luxury residences, 40 one-bedroom apartments and 32 two-bedroom apartments. All residences have modern interior design, double-glazed windows, central air conditioning, fiber optic internet connection, balconies with gorgeous panoramic views.Alba Tower residents have at their disposal the following amenities: shopping pavilions on the ground levels of the building, areas for walking and recreation with landscaped gardens, a large outdoor swimming pool, children's playgrounds, gym, parking at the basement of the building, barbecue areas.The complex is located amongst a large number of shopping facilities in Al Satwa district, there are also a number of good schools and kindergartens for children, medical centers, cafes and restaurants nearby.Alba Tower is located in the heart of Dubai's industrial life, just 9 minutes to Dubai World Trade Center, 10 minutes to Dubai Raam, 12 minutes to Museum of The Future, 15 minutes to Burj Khalifa, 15 minutes to Dubai Mall, 15 minutes to Jumeirah Grand Mosque, 16 minutes to Jumeirah Beach, 10 minutes to Dubai Metro, 15 minutes to Museum of The Future. The launch date will be known at a later date.","price":1005465,"title":"Alba Tower","bitrix":{"id":898,"pf_id":"are.3.14261","source":null,"project_id":"Jumeirah Garden City","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Alba Tower","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Reportage Properties","project_location":"Al Satwa"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2506/images/2024/07/17/340x252/TDUks1rpwYse81AS1a6ZusX2f53e4dYHPwPTl8TX.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/2506/images